  <content>
  <section id="sect-00001"><title>Warm Up Activity</title>
<para id="para-00001">Let \(p\) be the function that gives the cost \(p(t)\), in dollars, of producing 1 watt of solar energy
  \(t\)<emphasis> </emphasis>years after 1977. Here is a table showing the values of \(p\)<emphasis> </emphasis>from 1977 to 1987.</para>
